/*
 * Master reconstructed-object list
 *
 * This file intentionally has no include guard. It is an X-macro definition
 * file used to generate stable IDs and immutable scene-object metadata.
 *
 * Arguments:
 *   symbol
 *   semantic name
 *   owning scene
 *   parent object
 *   local x
 *   local y
 *   draw layer
 *   collision x
 *   collision y
 *   collision width
 *   collision height
 *   interaction x
 *   interaction y
 *   interaction width
 *   interaction height
 *   required restored collection
 *   object flags
 *   initially visible
 *   label definition
 *   interaction definition
 *   primitive array
 */

